flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[AI greeting, scope, fictional worked example]
 B --> C[Quick replies and style selection]
 C --> D[Student excerpt and question]
 D --> E{S1: in scope and enough context?}
 E -->|No: generation request| F[Explain scope and offer coaching]
 F --> C
 E -->|No: unclear| G[Ask one context question]
 G --> D
 E -->|Yes| H{S2: strong unambiguous evidence?}
 H -->|No| I[Explicit uncertainty and official source options]
 H -->|Yes| J[S3 prompt and S4 model/local response]
 J --> K{Model request succeeds?}
 K -->|No| L[Retry once with 10-second timeout]
 L --> M{Retry succeeds?}
 M -->|No| N[Calm fallback, preserved browser text, Try again]
 M -->|Yes| O{S5: JSON and exact allowed content valid?}
 K -->|Yes| O
 O -->|No| I
 O -->|Yes| P[S6 card: rule, source, text label, hint 1, evidence panel]
 P --> Q[Next/previous hint, Why, source only, edit, check another]
 Q -->|Hint| J
 Q -->|Check another| C
 Q -->|Done| R[Closure summary, ratings, Clear chat]
 I --> Q
 N -->|Try again| D
 N --> S[[Human handover options]]
 C -->|Talk to a person, always available| S
 P -->|Two unhelpful ratings| S
 S --> R
 R --> T([End or new check])
